<title>CHINA: Germany's Preussag invests in China crane plant.</title>
<headline>Germany's Preussag invests in China crane plant.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Preussag Group has opened an office in Beijing and announced it was to invest $42.35 million in building a joint venture crane factory, the Xinhua news agency said in an overnight report.</p>
<p>The group that manufactures facilities for environmental protection would cooperate with Chinese counterparts in developing China's environmental industry market, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>It gave no more details.</p>
</text>
